WP04 no-overclaim proof

Negative guarantees covered by parser tests:
- Display label alone cannot promote an app/game to deterministic identity.
- Same display label cannot merge identities without deterministic refs.
- Conflicting file hash refs block identity merge.
- Launcher-only refs stay launcher identity or candidate state, not known game.
- Parent label changes cannot create raw identity without shared deterministic
  refs.

Not in this slice:
- No OS inventory scan.
- No process runtime observation.
- No launcher manifest parser.
- No Rust protocol or SQLite identity merge.
- No portal product claim.
